# ── Docs ──
# Added at the user's request (Block 10-18 pass).
# CAVEAT: docs/precision.md, docs/timestep_and_stiffness.md, docs/trade_deck.md,
# docs/validation_targets.md and docs/handoff/handoff_phase0.md are ALREADY
# TRACKED. .gitignore only suppresses UNTRACKED files, so those five continue to
# appear in commits and to receive updates normally. Only new files under docs/
# — the per-block write-ups and the new handoff — are ignored.
# To untrack the existing five:  git rm --cached -r docs/
# Note also that the `!docs/**/*.png` negation above is now inert: git does not
# descend into an ignored directory, so a negation cannot re-include a file
# inside one.
docs/
